Package: fmri.pipeline
Type: Package
Title: Hierarchical fMRI GLMs with FSL, AFNI, and SPM
Version: 0.5
Date: 2026-11-13
Authors@R: c(person("Michael", "Hallquist", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "michael.hallquist@gmail.com"))
Maintainer: Michael Hallquist <michael.hallquist@gmail.com>
Description: Specify, run, and track hierarchical general linear models (GLMs)
    for task fMRI data with FSL, AFNI, and SPM. Generate suite-specific designs
    and contrasts from shared trial, run, and participant tables, and submit
    time-series and group analyses locally or through a cluster scheduler.
SystemRequirements: Runtime software depends on the analysis: FSL for FEAT,
    AFNI for AFNI GLMs and 3dLMEr, SPM12 with a configured MATLAB-compatible
    executable for SPM models.
License: GPL-3
BugReports: https://github.com/HallquistLab/fmri.pipeline/issues
